OL,3,AAI tools that take notes for GPs could
OL,4,Amiss vital information, study suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI tools that are used to take medical
OL,7,Fnotes from patients could miss vital
OL,8,Finformation and lead to medical staff
OL,9,Fbeing deskilled, according to new
OL,10,Fresearch.
OL,12,FThe tools, called ambient AI scribes,
OL,13,Fare used by about 40% of GPs in the UK.
OL,14,FThe scribes listen to conversations
OL,15,Fbetween doctors and patients and
OL,16,Fconvert the speech to text, generating
OL,17,Fwritten notes and letters.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
