OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAI tools that take notes for GPs could
OL,4,Amiss vital information, study suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcademics at University of Edinburgh
OL,7,Freviewed cases involving the scribes
OL,8,Fand found the tech had some positives,
OL,9,Fsuch as allowing clinicians to focus on
OL,10,Fcomplex tasks.
OL,12,FHowever, they also said patients could
OL,13,Fbe less forthcoming if they knew they
OL,14,Fwere being recorded and found instances
OL,15,Fwhere doctors did not recognise their
OL,16,Fnotes.
